  "label": "Self-Deprecating Humor",
  "description": "Self-deprecating humor is a comedic technique where a person makes fun of themselves or their own shortcomings. It is widely accepted and often used to create relatability and likability. The phrase 'my ass needed a break' is an example of this, as it humorously acknowledges physical fatigue without targeting anyone else, making it a safe and common form of humor.",
